  "releaseNotes": "Extended CFG008 to direct framework ConfigurationBinder.GetValue<T> reads when a visible appsettings scalar provably cannot convert to T. Resolves root and known section-chain paths, supports constant defaults, reuses host-provenance and conversion safety boundaries, deduplicates against options-binding diagnostics, and rejects non-framework/same-FQN shadows; missing, null, non-scalar, dynamic, effectful-default, member-origin, stored-section, local, mutated, escaped, and custom-provider reads remain quiet.",
